menu "Detection link test app"

    config DETECTION_LINK_TEST_QEMU
        bool "Run hardware-independent tests automatically (for QEMU)"
        default n
        help
            QEMU does not emulate the ESP32-C3 Wi-Fi radio, so the [hw] tests cannot run there.
            When enabled, the app runs every other test at boot, prints a summary line and
            stops, instead of showing the interactive test menu.

endmenu
